<rss xmlns:atom="http://www.w3.org/2005/Atom" version="2.0"><channel><title>差分数组 - 标签 - 豆浆小屋</title><link>https://soybeanmilk.netlify.app/tags/%E5%B7%AE%E5%88%86%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84/</link><description>差分数组 - 标签 - 豆浆小屋</description><generator>Hugo -- gohugo.io</generator><language>zh-CN</language><copyright>This work is licensed under a Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-ShareAlike 4.0 International License.</copyright><lastBuildDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</lastBuildDate><atom:link href="https://soybeanmilk.netlify.app/tags/%E5%B7%AE%E5%88%86%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84/" rel="self" type="application/rss+xml"/><item><title>差分数组知识点</title><link>https://soybeanmilk.netlify.app/%E5%B7%AE%E5%88%86%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%82%B9/</link><pubDate>Tue, 04 Aug 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><author><name>作者</name></author><guid>https://soybeanmilk.netlify.app/%E5%B7%AE%E5%88%86%E6%95%B0%E7%BB%84%E7%9F%A5%E8%AF%86%E7%82%B9/</guid><description><![CDATA[<h1 id="差分数组-difference-array" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e5%b7%ae%e5%88%86%e6%95%b0%e7%bb%84-difference-array" class="header-mark"></a>差分数组 (Difference Array)</h1><h2 id="核心思想" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e6%a0%b8%e5%bf%83%e6%80%9d%e6%83%b3" class="header-mark"></a>1 核心思想</h2><p>差分数组是<strong>前缀和的逆运算</strong>，适用于<strong>频繁对数组某个区间进行增减操作</strong>的场景。</p>
<ul>
<li>暴力做法：每次区间修改 O(n)，m 次操作 O(n*m)</li>
<li>差分数组：每次修改 O(1)，最后还原 O(n)，总复杂度 O(n + m)</li>
</ul>
<hr>
<h2 id="一基本原理" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e4%b8%80%e5%9f%ba%e6%9c%ac%e5%8e%9f%e7%90%86" class="header-mark"></a>2 一、基本原理</h2><h3 id="构造差分数组" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e6%9e%84%e9%80%a0%e5%b7%ae%e5%88%86%e6%95%b0%e7%bb%84" class="header-mark"></a>2.1 构造差分数组</h3><div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-fallback" data-lang="fallback"><span class="line"><span class="cl">diff[i] = nums[i] - nums[i-1]
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><table>
  <thead>
      <tr>
          <th>索引</th>
          <th>0</th>
          <th>1</th>
          <th>2</th>
          <th>3</th>
          <th>4</th>
      </tr>
  </thead>
  <tbody>
      <tr>
          <td>nums</td>
          <td>2</td>
          <td>5</td>
          <td>1</td>
          <td>4</td>
          <td>3</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
          <td>diff</td>
          <td>2</td>
          <td>3</td>
          <td>-4</td>
          <td>3</td>
          <td>-1</td>
      </tr>
  </tbody>
</table>
<h3 id="区间增减操作" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e5%8c%ba%e9%97%b4%e5%a2%9e%e5%87%8f%e6%93%8d%e4%bd%9c" class="header-mark"></a>2.2 区间增减操作</h3><p>对区间 <code>[i, j]</code> 的所有元素 <code>+val</code>：</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">diff</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">+=</span> <span class="n">val</span><span class="p">;</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">diff</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">j</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">-=</span> <span class="n">val</span><span class="p">;</span>   <span class="c1">// 注意边界：j+1 不能越界
</span></span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><p><strong>原理：</strong></p>
<ul>
<li><code>diff[i] += val</code> → 从 i 开始，后面所有元素都加了 val</li>
<li><code>diff[j+1] -= val</code> → 从 j+1 开始，抵消前面的增量</li>
<li>综合效果：只有 <code>[i, j]</code> 区间加了 val</li>
</ul>
<h3 id="还原结果数组" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e8%bf%98%e5%8e%9f%e7%bb%93%e6%9e%9c%e6%95%b0%e7%bb%84" class="header-mark"></a>2.3 还原结果数组</h3><p>对 diff 做一次前缀和，得到最终的 nums：</p>
<div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt">1
</span><span class="lnt">2
</span><span class="lnt">3
</span><span class="lnt">4
</span></code></pre></td>
<td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code class="language-cpp" data-lang="cpp"><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="n">res</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">diff</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="mi">0</span><span class="p">];</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="k">for</span> <span class="p">(</span><span class="kt">int</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">&lt;</span> <span class="n">n</span><span class="p">;</span> <span class="n">i</span><span class="o">++</span><span class="p">)</span> <span class="p">{</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl">    <span class="n">res</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">=</span> <span class="n">res</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span> <span class="o">-</span> <span class="mi">1</span><span class="p">]</span> <span class="o">+</span> <span class="n">diff</span><span class="p">[</span><span class="n">i</span><span class="p">];</span>
</span></span><span class="line"><span class="cl"><span class="p">}</span>
</span></span></code></pre></td></tr></table>
</div>
</div><hr>
<h2 id="二模板代码" class="headerLink">
    <a href="#%e4%ba%8c%e6%a8%a1%e6%9d%bf%e4%bb%a3%e7%a0%81" class="header-mark"></a>3 二、模板代码</h2><div class="highlight"><div class="chroma">
<table class="lntable"><tr><td class="lntd">
<pre tabindex="0" class="chroma"><code><span class="lnt"> 1
</span><span class="lnt"> 2
</span><span class="lnt"> 3
</span><span class="lnt"> 4
</span><span class="lnt"> 5
</span><span class="lnt"> 6
</span><span class="lnt"> 7
</span><span class="lnt"> 8
</span><span class="lnt"> 9
</span><span class="lnt">10
</span><span class="lnt">11
</span><span class="lnt">12
